<title>MOROCCO: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>MOROCCO GOVERNMENT LIST (960914)   **********************************************************</p>
<p>  * 14 Sept 96 - Results from the 13 September referendum  *</p>
<p>  *		  on constitutional reform showed 99.56 per *</p>
<p>  *		  cent voted in favour. The reforms will    *</p>
<p>  *		  lead to the scrapping of the existing     *</p>
<p>  *		  parliament and the formation of a new     *</p>
<p>  *		  lower house and upper assembly.	     *</p>
<p>  **********************************************************</p>
<p>				   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>  Head of State.................................King HASSAN II</p>
<p>				   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>GOVERNMENT: (Formed 28 Feb 95)</p>
<p>(For party affiliations see end of list)</p>
<p>  Prime Minister.......................Abdellatif FILALI (Ind)</p>
<p>(Installed 31 Jan 95)</p>
<p>(Also Minister of State for Foreign Affairs &amp; Cooperation)</p>
<p>				   - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS OF STATE: (Senior Ministers)</p>
<p>  Foreign Affairs &amp; Cooperation.............See Prime Minister</p>
<p>  Interior...................................Driss BASRI (Ind)</p>
<p>  Without portfolio.........................Ahmed ALAOUI (Ind)</p>
<p>				   - - - - - - -</p>
